    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19045" root="سحت" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحْتٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of 1 [q. v.]. (L, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also
(assumed tropical:)  <i>Vehemence of eating and drinking.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
(assumed tropical:)  <i>Punishment, castigation,</i> or <i>chastisement.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرْدٌ سَحْتٌ</span>, (K,) [as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَخْتٌ</span>, q. v.,] and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحْتٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحْتٌ</span>, (TA,) [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَخْتٌ</span>,] <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَادِقٌ</span>
[i. e. (assumed tropical:)  <i>Vehement,</i> or <i>intense, cold:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحْتٌ</span> &amp;c.].
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُحْتُوتٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْحُوتٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7- 
and see the paragraph here following, in two
places.

